2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623534_1686330326399334_8514892630752350751_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PObQyzL6GuoQ7kNvwFlBqlr&_nc_oc=AdrSV5h8BYFtlMr12QYbHjaAhpVpOm5WDgB0VlOs9L0TSEFVXZFzraHb_fnvqImNkSg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQObB2CVLmyj9ZHhiHjgxEtjIKOOnikjKmiGI9TOcX_Zcw&oe=6AC3AB3D"}, "display_name": "RC Brains: Mechs Update", "keywords": ["racing", "socialvr", "rccars", "vehicles", "mechs"], "long_description": "# RC BRAINS\nRC Brains is a chaotic Social VR playground where you play as a Brain, jump into RC vehicles, and race, fly, crash, explore, and hang out with friends.\n\n**Join the Community=>** https://discord.gg/rcbrains\n \n\n \n# DRIVE RC CARS IN VR\n{3874153959558303}\n\n# PILOT GIANT MECHS\n{28354157054211153}\n\n\nEnter BrainTech City, suit up in a giant mech, and move with your own arms.\n\nClimb, launch, grapple, swing between buildings, and master the city with friends.\n\n# FLY RC DRONES & PLANES IN VR\n{3744554712353768}\n{2225960998146844}\n\n# PILOT GIANT MECHS\n{28354157054211153}\n\n\nEnter BrainTech City, suit up in a giant mech, and move with your own arms.\n\nClimb, launch, grapple, swing between buildings, and master the city with friends.\n\n\n# BECOME THE BRAIN\n{4300031590325704}\n\nJump into RC vehicles, hang out with friends, and create funny moments across the playground.\n\nRace, fly, crash, earn rewards, and become the Brain everyone remembers.\n\n{1526593175742234}\n\n", "short_description": "Play as a Brain in a chaotic Social VR playground! Jump into RC cars, fly RC planes, hang out with friends, earn Brain Bits, and build your RESPECT!"}]}, "developer_name": "AshRift Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rcbrains-privacypolicy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AshRift Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rcbrains-privacypolicy/home", "category": null